WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:36.130
For a hundred years the Astragius galaxy
had been split by war.

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:40.210
I was ordered into an operation
whose details were kept from me.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:45.630
There, my destiny was changed
the moment I saw her.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:50.920
She was apparently the military's greatest secret.

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:56.460
Since deserting the army, my wanderings
had brought me to the city of Uoodo.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:00.420
But, for a man like me
who only knows how to fight...

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:03.210
combat in this city was something
I could not avoid.

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:08.420
And within the battle, I met her once more.

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:12.580
She's deeply tied to my destiny.

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.170
But what sort of destiny is it?

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:20.460
Rescue

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:42.130
You're no match for that!

00:02:44.460 --> 00:02:46.330
Throw Chirico into the transport!

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.920
I'm sure it's the Prototype!

00:02:50.920 --> 00:02:52.130
I'll confirm ASAP.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:54.380
No, don't do anything to arouse suspicion.

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:56.210
The police are covering that place too closely.

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:59.330
Just let the Prototype go and
find out her connection to them.

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:10.170
So, how's it feel to hold
three billion gildans, Pops?

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:12.960
Great! Just great!

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:40.040
What kept you? How'd it go?

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:42.580
Total success.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:43.920
Let me see! Let me see!

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.880
I can't lift this myself. Help me out here!

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:47.790
Okay.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.580
Okay! Put it over there.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:59.920
I never knew something this cold
could feel so good!

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:03.210
We're now officially the
richest people under the sun.

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:06.330
No kidding! But that was
one close call we had getting it.

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:10.000
Yeah, they tried to double-cross us,
just like you predicted.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.130
Hell, even a cop would want to keep this!

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:16.210
If Chirico hadn't been there,
we never would have made it.

00:04:16.210 --> 00:04:19.040
He's a hell of a VOTOM jockey.
That Chirico sure has guts!

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:22.210
I wish I could have seen him fight.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.790
Don't be too thankful you're still alive.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.880
I'll take my time getting it out of you
back at headquarters...

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:35.500
just who you're working for!

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:36.710
Bring him along!

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:37.500
Inside!

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:48.460
The cops have taken him.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:49.790
Watch him.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:50.540
Yes, sir.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:07.040
You poor bastard.
Your two friends ran out on you.

00:05:07.210 --> 00:05:09.210
They aren't my friends.

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:11.290
Quit talking tough!

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:13.670
Think they'll come and save you or something?

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:16.330
They'd never do anything that dangerous.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.630
I've meant nothing to them from the start.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:20.830
You really sound mad at them.

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.040
Not surprised, really.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:24.630
They cared about their money
more than about you.

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:27.540
Oh well, we'll catch them soon enough.

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:29.080
They can't get away.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:36.000
This is really all ours?

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:38.920
Uh-huh. We can buy anything we want.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:43.540
We can finally ditch this crummy life
and make our dreams come true!

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:46.080
This is no time to relax.

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:49.710
No one lives around here, but the police choppers
are wandering all over the place.

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:51.790
Yeah, this is no time to get careless.

00:05:51.790 --> 00:05:53.460
We have to think about how to get out of here.

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:56.380
They'll catch us for sure
if we leave in this fancy buggy.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.420
Yeah, you're right. What do we do?

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:02.330
Hey, Chirico's kinda late, isn't he?
What's going on?

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.250
She's right.

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:08.000
Yeah, pretty late.

00:06:08.330 --> 00:06:10.960
He was having a tough time with the cops.

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:13.460
They were blasting him
like there was no tomorrow.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:15.500
You don't suppose Chirico was...?

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:17.460
He might have been.

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:19.830
You're saying Chirico was in trouble?

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:22.380
Yeah, well, maybe a little.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:26.330
He got all pissed off at the cops.

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:29.040
Maybe he got in too deep and got killed.

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:33.210
You mean Chirico was in trouble
and you two just left him there?

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:36.330
No! It wasn't like that.
You see, there was... Uh...

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.500
Right, Vanilla?

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.330
Huh? Uh, yeah.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.290
C'mon, Coconna. It wasn't that simple.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:47.080
If we'd tried to do anything, well...
we woulda... you know.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:51.460
So, Chirico... Chirico might be dead?

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:58.130
It's a shame, but he did volunteer
to play bodyguard.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.210
Chirico's...!

00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:04.500
Coconna, he might've gotten away
safe and sound, like we did.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:05.880
Don't give up on him.

00:07:05.880 --> 00:07:09.420
Still, we should think of how the three of us
can get away with the money.

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:14.500
Hide! It's the cops!

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:19.330
Wasn't that the jeep from the exchange?

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.500
Maybe. Take us down!

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:37.130
Hey, that's...

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:37.880
Yeah.

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:49.830
This is...

00:07:49.830 --> 00:07:51.330
What's going on?

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:00.830
Well then, shall we take their chopper?

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:16.790
Okay, load on the money.

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:20.630
They're being called.

00:08:20.630 --> 00:08:21.710
What do we do?

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.540
They'll be suspicious if nobody answers.

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:26.040
Leave this to me.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:29.420
Yeah, hello! This is...

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:32.290
This is Unit 3. Go ahead.

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:36.080
This is the chief.
Have you spotted that jeep yet?

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.670
Chief! Not yet, sir!

00:08:38.670 --> 00:08:40.130
We're still looking.

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:42.210
They couldn't have gotten far.

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:43.580
Look harder!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.830
Sir! We'll give it our all!

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:49.250
Can we have a report from your end, sir?

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:50.750
Never mind!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:53.080
We're taking the prisoner to HQ. All quiet!

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:56.040
Roger. Continuing search. Out.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:59.830
Chirico... Chirico's all right!

00:09:00.460 --> 00:09:02.210
Yeah, but it looks like they caught him, though.

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.750
He may as well be dead.

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.920
The cops'll never let him live.

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:08.670
Of all the rotten luck.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:11.830
Oh well, if we hang around we'll get caught, too.

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.500
We gotta get out of the city!

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:14.710
Right, let's go.

00:09:14.710 --> 00:09:15.880
Hold it!

00:09:15.880 --> 00:09:16.920
What's with you?

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:19.210
We know Chirico's still alive.

00:09:19.210 --> 00:09:21.000
We can't just run out on him!

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.920
What are you saying we should do?

00:09:22.920 --> 00:09:24.290
You aren't seriously suggesting...!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:28.540
Look, if we stay here, we could lose the money!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:31.000
Chirico's our friend!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:34.330
You mean friends don't matter
as long as you've got your money?

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:38.250
Calm down, Coconna. This can't be helped.

00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:43.500
He's right. I feel sorry for him,
but why do something useless?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.460
Think about it.

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.290
No, I won't!

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:50.130
You guys are just running out on a friend!

00:09:52.460 --> 00:09:55.710
I never thought you were that low!

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:58.080
You're even lower than low!

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:02.040
Well, look. Maybe he'll escape.

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.460
Y-yeah, right. Sure he will.

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:06.790
Scum! Monster! Coward!

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:11.170
He gave up his share and went to protect you!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.290
And he's the only one who got caught!

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:16.040
Everything he did he did for us!

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.960
Yeah, well...

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:21.040
I guess, but...

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:24.960
He's done you guys favors
and never did you any wrong!

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:28.880
Just letting a friend like that die isn't human!

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:32.920
Only scum do that.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:36.040
She sure makes us
sound like cowards, doesn't she?

00:10:36.210 --> 00:10:37.420
Shall we do it, Vanilla?

00:10:37.920 --> 00:10:39.960
What the hell? Let's.

00:10:39.960 --> 00:10:42.750
Times like this I wish
I really was a heartless bastard.

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:44.630
Hell, we'll figure something out.

00:10:46.630 --> 00:10:47.880
We will! We will!

00:10:56.960 --> 00:10:59.790
Grenades! These should come in handy.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:01.460
We'll blow the cops away!

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:03.750
Careful, or you'll blow our money away, too!

00:11:03.750 --> 00:11:04.920
There it is!

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.710
That's gotta be the wagon with Chirico inside.

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:12.920
That's a major escort they've got.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:13.960
We'll never be able to take 'em.

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:15.790
If we don't hurry, they'll get into the city!

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:18.750
We may have a chance then.
It's gonna be a wild ride.

00:11:46.670 --> 00:11:48.670
I think they're headed down that street.

00:11:48.670 --> 00:11:52.540
Yeah, that'll be the best place to spring Chirico.

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:54.040
Then it'll just be up to him.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:22.380
Hey, have a look at this. She's runnin' funny.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.710
Hey, Pops!

00:12:24.710 --> 00:12:26.580
Fill 'er up! And hurry!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:33.000
You're gonna need to replace some parts.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:36.380
What're you talkin' about?
I just had 'em replaced!

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:39.380
Well, then you got ripped off.

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:42.750
Why, you... Don't jerk me around!

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:46.920
I'll teach you to try and take
advantage of a guy's bad luck!

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:48.380
What the hell?

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.290
Stop, thief!

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:54.330
Son of a...!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.420
Why, you...! What's the big idea?

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:57.960
Somebody, stop him!

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:09.630
You got it, Coconna?

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:11.710
I'm okay. I think...

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.290
We've got a truck coming straight at us!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:20.250
You in the truck! Halt!

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:23.420
Who are they? If they don't stop, shoot them!

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:24.960
Go straight through!

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:27.790
We're going in!

00:13:27.790 --> 00:13:28.790
Gotcha!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:45.630
Them!

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:52.420
Return fire!

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:09.170
Gotcha!

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:15.290
Give me a flash round!

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.290
Chirico, run for it!

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.170
Drop your gun!

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:41.330
Nuts!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:43.290
Damn, didn't work!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:44.710
Chirico...

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:46.830
Drop it now!

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.290
This is for wasting my time!

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:54.630
Get up!

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:59.040
Now, will you please get in there again?

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.460
Okay, get ready to move out!

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:03.170
I want the armored car out in front!

00:15:21.500 --> 00:15:22.790
It didn't work.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:26.420
Looks like we'll have to
give up on good ol' Chirico.

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:27.830
We came so close.

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:30.040
He's the unluckiest guy in the world!

00:15:30.040 --> 00:15:31.750
May as well start making him a tombstone.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:33.580
Stop saying he's unlucky!

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:35.420
We gave it our best shot.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:37.500
Let it go, Coconna.

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:40.500
We'll use his money to buy
a really nice headstone-

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.540
Money...

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:43.250
Yeah, the money!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.670
We still have a chance!

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:49.460
All we have to do is
dump all the gold from the air.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.130
And then let the virtuous citizens
of Uoodo do the rest for us.

00:15:52.960 --> 00:15:54.960
I get you. Good idea.

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:59.040
Uoodo's walking dead'll start acting
like sharks in a feeding frenzy.

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.960
Of course, it involves dumping all our money!

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:02.540
Don't you dare!

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.130
You really are scum!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.750
You'd still want the money
even if Chirico got killed?

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:10.040
No, that's not what I meant.

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:12.040
Well, what did you mean then?

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:16.130
When you get old,
your body starts telling you things.

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:19.130
How about you just leave me some money?

00:16:19.130 --> 00:16:22.000
The hell we will, you old fox!

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:27.880
Say, Coconna, why don't we just
throw Chirico's cut out?

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.580
Gotta think about the future-

00:16:29.580 --> 00:16:30.710
Uh-uh!

00:16:30.710 --> 00:16:32.170
We throw it all out.

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:33.710
All of it!

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:37.880
Oh, boy...

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:59.540
It's the cops.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.080
Outta the way! Clear the street!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.080
You're giving me the creeps!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:08.750
You haven't moved a bit.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.880
I dunno what your problem is,
just stop staring straight ahead!

00:17:23.580 --> 00:17:25.960
Parting is such sweet sorrow.

00:17:28.920 --> 00:17:30.750
They're coming back again?

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:33.750
They're back?

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:35.710
What's going on up there?

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:39.540
One...

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:41.040
Two...

00:17:41.380 --> 00:17:42.540
Three...

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:43.710
Four...

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:45.420
What are you doing?

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:48.380
That won't do anything!
You gotta do lots of it! Look!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:52.790
You know what they say about girls
being loose with money.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:54.670
If you're a man you'll let it all go!

00:17:55.830 --> 00:17:58.830
Oh, the hell with it! Take it, you damned thieves!

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:03.460
Fire! Shoot them down this time!

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:06.500
Ow!

00:18:07.290 --> 00:18:08.380
What the...?

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:10.210
It's gold!

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:13.500
What's happening?

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:14.880
It's raining gold!

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:17.380
God's giving us a break for a change!

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:20.380
Holy cripes, it's real gold!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:25.460
Here!

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:26.670
Take it!

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.130
God, I can't look.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:31.330
Out with the bad, in with the good!

00:18:31.330 --> 00:18:33.580
To hell with the cops!

00:18:33.580 --> 00:18:35.330
Damn them! Damn them!

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:37.000
The gold's falling over there now!

00:18:42.960 --> 00:18:44.830
Clear the way! Come on!

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:47.170
Clear out or I'll shoot!

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:51.210
Hey, that's my gold! Hands off or I'll shoot!

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:06.250
No, stop it! Stop it!

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:09.040
You stupid...

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.500
You're all obstructing police business!
You all want to get arrested?

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.790
Come on, hands off!

00:19:16.790 --> 00:19:20.080
Everything that falls up here is mine, okay?

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:21.080
What the...?

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:21.960
Gold!

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:22.880
I'm outta here!

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:25.420
Hey, pal. That's concealment of lost property.

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:26.580
Confiscated.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.630
Why, you...!

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:31.290
I'm sick and tired of these guys! Let's get 'em!

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:47.170
What the...?

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:50.670
G-gold!

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:56.250
What are you doing?

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:58.130
Arrest them! Arrest them all!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:02.420
Come on, Chirico!

00:20:02.750 --> 00:20:05.630
We gave up all our loot to rescue you!

00:20:05.630 --> 00:20:06.790
You'd better appreciate this!

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.460
Hold it!

00:20:09.380 --> 00:20:10.460
Outta the way!

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:13.500
Arrest them all!

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:16.580
Why, you... What are you doing?

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:21.380
So, you cost us three billion gildans.

00:20:21.540 --> 00:20:23.580
That was one hell of a shopping trip!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:37.170
So, Chirico has gotten away from the police?

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.330
Mission change.

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:41.630
Have headquarters send reinforcements.

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:42.170
Yes, sir!

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:54.880
You're a pain in the ass, you know that?

00:20:54.880 --> 00:20:59.420
You start off telling us
you don't want any money...

00:20:59.420 --> 00:21:01.920
and we still end up broke!

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:07.250
If we hang around with you, we'll lose all
our money and probably our lives, too!

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:10.670
No kidding. He's nothing but trouble!

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:13.750
But we rescued you anyway.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:16.040
You're one lucky guy, you know that?

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:19.290
You saved me.

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:21.290
I owe you.

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:32.080
What did you just say?

00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:36.790
I said you saved me and now I owe you.

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:41.290
Stop that! We're friends, right?

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:44.040
Exactly. That's why we saved you.

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:46.580
Sure, we're all broke again, but we don't mind.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:47.880
Quit lying!

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:49.210
What do you mean?

00:21:49.790 --> 00:21:56.580
You really think we wouldn't notice
your cape jingling? Huh, Pops?

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.460
You grabbed some for yourself
during the riot, didn't you?

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:02.790
Oh, no! I was just going to use it
to throw my friends a party.

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:05.000
You're a real sneak!

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.540
I suppose this is for food for the party?

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:13.750
For your information, I was going to buy some
Kankaran medicine roots. For Chirico!

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:16.580
Gee, think you have a enough to buy
something that expensive?

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:21.920
Well, what do you know?

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:23.500
Give it back!

00:22:26.080 --> 00:22:27.330
Why, you dirty...!

00:22:29.420 --> 00:22:32.880
We really are all partners, huh?

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:41.710
Friends...

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:44.540
I was almost embarrassed to feel it.

00:22:45.250 --> 00:22:50.460
But a long dead warmth had begun to
rekindle somewhere in my heart.

00:22:53.960 --> 00:22:55.380
Next Episode

00:22:55.710 --> 00:22:57.790
Shoulders soaked with the enemy's blood.

00:22:57.790 --> 00:22:59.670
They were called Hell's Battalion.

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:03.170
In Uoodo, ghosts of the Hundred Years War are resurrected.

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:06.040
On the plains of Parumis, and in Miyoite sector...

00:23:06.040 --> 00:23:09.080
he was one of Melkia's
unbeatable Armored Troopers.

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:12.040
A heartless, lifeless soldier of steel.

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:15.210
A life worth three billion gildans.

00:23:15.210 --> 00:23:17.580
The ultimate one-man army.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.630
Next time, "Red Shoulder"

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.920
Red Shoulder

00:23:19.330 --> 00:23:23.920
Next Time

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:22.580
Will Chirico's instincts lead him towards danger?

00:23:42.210 --> 00:23:45.670
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:45.670 --> 00:23:49.210
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.210 --> 00:23:55.580
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:59.630
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.630 --> 00:24:03.040
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:09.290
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.290 --> 00:24:12.790
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:12.790 --> 00:24:16.210
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.380 --> 00:24:22.710
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.080 --> 00:24:29.040
Brighter than any other light...
